<Layout title="Your Data Center Has 10,000 Sensors. MOJO's Health Agent Is the Only One Listening. — Metify" description="Traditional monitoring is expensive noise. MOJO's health agent uses AI to reason about fleet telemetry — learned baselines, Z-score anomaly detection, and autonomous action.">
